  "guidance_candidates": [
    {
      "text": "Critical or complementary",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Critical or complementary"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "df8abdd3cfcde4238e541b0928ba16ebabf01794b6f9fb0576a9f72cc8901fd9",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The keyboard uses machine learning to provide QuickType suggestions. Because the keyboard still works without these suggestions, machine learning",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Critical or complementary"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4d83bfb0ba52de2fba3bbe57e60391d4ca699d83d61db275ec776a359d5db777",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Face ID relies on machine learning to perform accurate face recognition. Without machine learning, Face ID would not work",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Critical or complementary"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "fbd7ab7497dc792f79c4b6ef6f1494dbac5a21119c10b66a4ea7e6078bbe1d21",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Private or public",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Private or public"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6dacde1225d25e1dfe003ef734cdc9bf2d6462381fe637c14b8d190d57ebd8dc",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "If a health app misinterprets data and incorrectly recommends a visit to the doctor, people are likely to experience",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Private or public"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "dacc4bb31ea533a53b308a7deacde77ae950a97dc122b74e5349cfe3d646d1a2",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "If a music app misinterprets data and recommends an artist that people don’t like, they’re likely to view the",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Private or public"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "20ccfa7237bb50e191f71b7996c0714b765afb82f55062a50a491a6ec91c1903",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Proactive or reactive",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Proactive or reactive"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "10d8fe231779d607e9ba9c867038feb7221f1887537d7d2ace0b8ed6b4fc75c6",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Siri Suggestions can proactively suggest a shortcut based on people’s recent routines",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Proactive or reactive"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6fb261daa0a12f684ed4aee7e3f44467c81648e528ed941563dabce1d219e14a",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "QuickType suggests words in reaction to what people type",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Proactive or reactive"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4a74a5b71b0d10274965c01144ef7e18cc22b5487e33f8fd214c5181a8d7fa10",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Visible or invisible",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Visible or invisible"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "851e6dc9c5fd9c073675a01edf1a6896243d243d823620e439520369e025f2ac",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Dynamic or static",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Dynamic or static"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "12d9d4e762bff6a251124d7f7647e6015da0e6dd85ca2d5a41ec563c2baa8591",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Request explicit feedback only when necessary",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "37887674ecff1448bc21f3a21ea853321033f1adf5bc56cdd4f50f790586f3b0",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Always make providing explicit feedback a voluntary task",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "bbc4518982a469afd7b510b9cd4e4316597642f88d8743669ce222c52f903eb6",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Use simple, direct language to describe each explicit feedback option and its consequences",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8f4d31f37cf0519b76ea6516befc61e81bd912376a519f7e6a580ee602342617",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Suggest less pop music",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "35ce3bfcebc9c77bcbfa3849bb02d2aaf3cd407832122896a423de366520dbd5",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Suggest more thrillers",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "75d2358c120ce4390e43f9c8ba2e342b5c47d5b3a4bfcd08833874b2cc98a4ea",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Mute politics for a week",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6e55f73e2aa630fa9e50dd5ec298c80b89ce61a16437001fb412143bd69cac6e",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Add icons to an option description if it helps people understand it",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0f08f4468915e9658a4ab7651cd089478de883825adcaf13e50b90e934962ad7",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider offering multiple options when requesting explicit feedback",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1f24bc73fb6985f01eb9cc65a9e3c1bdd0ad0b0dde7e6b5b8f27a6e57820cc36",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Act immediately when you receive explicit feedback and persist the resulting changes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "dde07b18f9d3d03f48d4a66f1b746bb8363dfb84634ba0f5ed33753dc826501e",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider using explicit feedback to help improve when and where you show results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4dff81df56a4323010dd5483d683c4fe9651493d3ac2fca5a06a11e6a5a992fe",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Always secure people’s information",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b91d4a19c28b6ee95ce4143b218257faced19baea00ee5cd4f0663d16e612349",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Help people control their information",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "33e0a68d0450b61bbb09c76e3df46c736f4cd32b0c242f1d3cf04f9627cd7bb5",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Don’t let implicit feedback decrease people’s opportunities to explore",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d653eee71d348ede1b205c403758f93b99e70626c4c9aea92301aa4fc335c03d",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "When possible, use multiple feedback signals to improve suggestions and mitigate mistakes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c954e551aa04ad94f39d3f0f51f1183b318017fe0824316ccf7904bc68bf29e9",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider withholding private or sensitive suggestions",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b47bc529aa5a32661db1acb5b1a2ffec0dfc191de94d636e2477c87888e6a5ef",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Prioritize recent feedback",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3effebbd57647ec047afd8b88803a7d0df3eda39c64c42ae3635b6e4123fbb46",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Use feedback to update predictions on a cadence that matches the person’s mental model of the feature",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e0d27e510bfb799aced6320145f951561b10b3fc1492b9ea8115e495174fde63",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Be prepared for changes in implicit feedback when you make changes to your app’s UI",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "129a90d234ef3d9c893ccfcc40060e383258211cc3dcb1ac6f8157982edcd947",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Beware of confirmation bias",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "47e680fee488113be47660112cbe41741836308270da0152ca3d2227a71e8723",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Always secure people’s information",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b91d4a19c28b6ee95ce4143b218257faced19baea00ee5cd4f0663d16e612349",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Be clear about why you need people’s information",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7c2fcbd697748a79a9ad67a6bbe85f3537f7921a241e2014ef815a08a6596e65",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Collect only the most essential information",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c3309be1ff60e19e8f4003f7e42cdb2061ed6b3c6a4a60a5a8a22c852450e200",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid asking people to participate in calibration more than once",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e1695518c46bd1b7e122a1bf8caafe9d15f9a83f4268b658acb9c2c6e64224af",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Make calibration quick and easy",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f1354133e07ec02bdbb556a1e54540f4edb593cf202b780a35a526c3a6cba125",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Prioritize getting a few pieces of important information and infer the rest from other sources or by getting people’s",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c6b09c9d4bf6a44b275312c8a61f8531836e09d6515b3b84ffc69fab4e9ab48e",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid asking for information that most people would have to look up",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "09f9dc0eaaa1692d22b26e4fdb19dc9b42827f0f4f8851d27ac96bfa10fd2a9d",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid asking people to perform actions that might be difficult",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "68debb2c1649748ee8c0e5f141e296a0f9459d5bddad265c299f3973dbcf5944",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sure people know how to perform calibration successfully",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6fec911a5542a74401d0631434ebc8e9b1a7cdc25d930fa013a9fc57ed1949d1",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Immediately provide assistance if progress stalls",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "eeec05e89f0c69d22f81ac284c6752ab203c28b3819cb1dd1b6a9de455fe0f8e",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Confirm success",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9e89fa886716496c498018fe321a054f49a734fbe0d39fe6a42ba2e520e0d849",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Let people cancel calibration at any time",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "89c5745028d6829f3ef2d4431eecfc4481cee5879751824553078ddf3ca0087f",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Give people a way to update or remove information they provided during calibration",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "050efec130d3db40078ef8ffc7538685079927aca2b2c87d900ec565e231d3d5",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Anticipate mistakes. As much as possible, design ways to avoid mistakes and mitigate them when they happen",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e6a3b1ba67f804edff2379e7bc2b4afa3e02dc158b71d6e20c9dc694c1893598",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Help people handle mistakes. Mistakes can have a wide range of consequences, so the tools you provide to handle",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9dc82a302a49340c046d544c11dddb0da775f2d34a8b9cf805542831ffea2ca9",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitations help you set people’s expectations about the accuracy of your suggestions",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9f767445b72c6a4cf02615fb0dde7e4ddae198a0d3d8a48bf6ae78ee65d8c646",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Corrections give people a way to be successful even when your results are wrong",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4fdd55747ec629bd76bfcd6ab11b5019a3ab6314227f2d99b04efac6e89ecde4",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Attribution gives people insight into where suggestions come from, which can help them understand mistakes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ab5c842503e0c323a47d0f3236cba33ae18eb05ce52575a26f837764b7992c9b",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Confidence helps you gauge the quality of your results, which can impact how you present them",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "93c31f690c7ebe3b981f0a7c6d13d612d18c1054243e5af37bfd6c860fc19f71",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Feedback — both explicit and implicit — lets people tell you about mistakes that you might not be aware",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8ebc2c45fa91d87446b0d918ae53bf4ef72ac7c70874bec6f23670438ba199dd",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Understand the significance of a mistake’s consequences",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "48d991f2eb08396fdaf3fbf451935937d6165c3959f98b4887ea97510960edbc",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it easy for people to correct frequent or predictable mistakes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9c6d4cda11808c7538e4b28c9c1adf34c2ff53867375afe23239c9e8b59ed2f3",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuously update your feature to reflect people’s evolving interests and preferences and help avoid mistakes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0740ef4ad77d11aaa31d450f0f0d893d67f46d3f4d7d86e2fdb1025f82dc036f",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "When possible, address mistakes without complicating the UI",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "229c202c0e13785bd1b2f79855ce647c63caff5b722cc475f5c98e2e0789c76a",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Be especially careful to avoid mistakes in proactive features",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1591d644d8284176150dd69d481c479fc9f9196b84be020efa3e27e010fadc36",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "As you work on reducing mistakes in one area, always consider the effect your work has on other areas",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e7316532391155ca4e9de23a7ae9affcc7f63c8c836c82ee086276e7e38c6b17",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Give people familiar, easy ways to make corrections",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "680e0c8307a5527765b1d419049145ea65bdcc5b879c5f087c4c50a5ac57018f",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Provide immediate value when people make a correction",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c77cda145f4652446277acfb0419014a63184d1cddecf88fe9a88622d5ee312c",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Let people correct their corrections",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3be4602f24749111d9ec9fc9db49a0c8e0f9a254c2a5ae6592e4daa7de47e8ed",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Always balance the benefits of a feature with the effort required to make a correction",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b6467572f2542a7d068355e1fe070fb23e42534b9bfc0c8d36afd6f2e4003df9",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Never rely on corrections to make up for low-quality results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c62e5b2c4638d8e4a0829948f0062fe3346a838b7c694ecff8e8eac772f41be3",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Learn from corrections when it makes sense",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6713e2f8e817615df232f1403fb168ccd3e8734e66a7a5a6eadacc4400835c26",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "When possible, use guided corrections instead of freeform corrections",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4cbf13876a318747abc735feef2d9f70c0de2e482b7d14676ed8895a8fe15236",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Suggested options, a proactive feature that suggests content to people based on their past interactions. For example, For You",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "fbd5b0e60fa763be5c5f4222a53014ccdfe82c638222566cf3aa03333f3ecca2",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Requested options, a reactive feature that suggests potential next steps to people based on their recent actions. For example,",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "16395d23db389eaf7b69e9d336727a436fc90889399fec1e2023b07fb53c08bf",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Corrections, which are actions people take to fix mistakes your app has made when it’s acting on their behalf.",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e17fa2e199311c82f40b57f7e28852df7855fe937c202f488994afb887bece27",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer diverse options",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e6711f01d33403012f36447c0b4303b534413a1807e90ee35b08b39f6a1e321f",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "In general, avoid providing too many options",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8e9f4dd1e3eb82c89bbab46d4b6bed3f7636202a037cc6297a46f7ee1baf1de1",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "List the most likely option first",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "80918e80b4139568b2ece80ac218569cb8d97c78312bdfa01c24710bde5389c6",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Make options easy to distinguish and choose",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "80bc3e55bbbe4ddd4ece09fe00af50b18438177d208cc38fd3e02b48d950c7b5",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Learn from selections when it makes sense",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "96a9e069ec35c7a45332d05d9a9c2724cb84e80763070e0bed03be505cb3634d",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Know what your confidence values mean before you decide how to present them",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "14865d8839f77dee13fed8197869b01ac454cc41c27c8fe3daec2394cdde5d60",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "In general, translate confidence values into concepts that people already understand",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ef3f35c30c529959aac470b9bb798db1b44b96722d54a117db7cf5a0029cedef",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "In situations where attributions aren’t helpful, consider ranking or ordering the results in a way that implies confidence levels",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e6220a4a1ba3a823c65cee50e9a5dee2d2fb14e996729d3205bfb2aef3243956",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "In scenarios where people expect statistical or numerical information, display confidence values that help them interpret the results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6b914d678d457381c3f835929c27c7181f28c304bb1adb5b2b14c47f7b713b28",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever possible, help people make decisions by conveying confidence in terms of actionable suggestions",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b268211330c730ccadf070890a200ce0f6d1027df62605b95aea19e2243e4b48",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider changing how you present results based on different confidence thresholds",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a15b3d505fbe8fe32269057fba81342e050ef7c140e614c96b95b21774d105fd",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "When you know that confidence values correspond to result quality, you generally want to avoid showing results when confidence",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "97bd49e9114b5e58d4642800b8ffe8a3cd65e501d4b2ee4970f574e47e474987",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Encourage people to change what they do in your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0dad223cdf1ceda613581b5b0066ee32204f58ebfa81ec3662666f45e3645325",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Minimize the impact of mistakes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "21c605a48aee8e23f583fc800669f525057f3067ac41506c4f403ae4d075c375",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Help people build a mental model of your feature",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "cd8e8855a19cbbf9841e88dcc11af86861c041b5c0ad0eb6a1a62f6c4f4418e8",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Promote trust in your app over time",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "34d72bb157a334dea5cc242daa79bc4196940eccfc6f897f7406201fe36f4d47",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider using attributions to help people distinguish among results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5f9fee0dd1adb024eea7f09942d5a8ab6fc5a166b0fedee45f113bc6c795664c",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid being too specific or too general",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1213bc7ec51ebea1ee10e432a4f76694784d9ee638ef87bc451739cd4678b874",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep attributions factual and based on objective analysis",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "65fe4034f4f49b6cf982012f34b11ea1875ca4ad42cfb73def30f717a85f9f10",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "In general, avoid technical or statistical jargon",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4c29913480602054cc5553abeb6de8a8910c9e6d0551e681bbbff9e456daaf7f",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Set people’s expectations before they use the feature",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "93ed5ed9be2610069197b7b4e035cf4f702e615231b30359469934a7f2e8d927",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Show people how to get the best results while they’re using the feature",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "57a53099253158cf87217e6f0319e05b91521abdb4185e71c5790b731f219c24",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "When inferior results occur, explain why so that people can understand the feature better",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5ea6dcc02bcbfcf1fe1054b6e7f16d382ddda9931780c2a5ff4fd4f3910433d5",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Help people establish realistic expectations",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "76a1e5481783ab7f8897360243c569233eddcdc24d8b852325b281a1e12bfcdc",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Demonstrate how to get the best results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0be46d3184605db6fc50f1ea4abd65e50b9ea1363882f056e77e814a7a33590d",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Suggest alternative ways to accomplish the goal instead of showing no results. To do this successfully, you need to",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c97965a6b2ad175bb20a539952415066dc9bda95e187a1bfb9fe505f6ab535a4",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Explain how limitations can cause unsatisfactory results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f32e521090086bed51b9ad5a516398b777229927d570a0eb1a10ef3b7706da09",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider telling people when limitations are resolved",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "dff59ba612e13781cbb04f64bd6f7263825aca9f301d1cb209bc19f2399ab787",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the machine learning role you identify to help you define ways your app can receive and display data",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Planning your design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "fe6ebed228e1eed5d1dd208ca1257d4a8b36d2a21b19e16265fbb1ce34afdbe8",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "you need to know as much as possible about the types of data your app’s feature needs",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Private or public"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "814435ea5ccf1f2ab7046d9443389aa7b5c0d86cfd7056048ad75c1fc9f83e75",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "must prioritize accuracy and reliability",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Private or public"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c2be8580532394e28139c99ced79d0b42a9c269fe1a332e80591cc69c530dbd2",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "must protect user privacy at all times",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "The role of machine learning in your app",
        "Private or public"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e4961503f77f1cc0642ef080cd1ebcb3883e63d5e488afd5f38aa0869b02054a",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid using an icon by itself",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ab5f8382b2be53567ce3623898f7cdab74edf8b8f7735d5d304f0872f983be45",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "hide it from their view",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1e54eebb1cdbec92d827849cca8d543d5508c951a3ec21a4d5c4822430d901d4",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "ensure it doesn’t appear elsewhere in your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Explicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "22564cc1f35448f89d2d65f10f020d69861fbab8447c6b502b4b43fbb3d25019",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "use multiple feedback signals to improve suggestions and mitigate mistakes",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "388433b47f40ab09440556b63cbac805a93b3d78962716f62f086ec22ddb6602",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid relying solely on implicit feedback to inform your results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f45efe39eab1226c1b47a4b662217fb8692dc3e2f0548dc66fbbb2a06a33e812",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "avoid offering recommendations based on that feedback",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Implicit feedback"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3e28a9e6456571430793e92d8c51791531df7ed60fdfdd946a106edd27775370",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "consider using other ways to gather the information you need",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3cb2aa3267aa336773c50f7bf303fd24305935b1bf870d68c6fbef85896ae351",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "give them an explicit goal",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a6a70a43d0caa1a8f224a8c79b6b08ba86985cc47ac1d4685ccfa15a43db0deb",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "show their progress toward it",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f37b8ace11004b1ddcf99594cf0bb8ac4b13ffb310ee5938a86c0dd17cf6a414",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "provide assistance if progress stalls",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "66d2db9570f1fc771706e908d1c4dbd9edd3412c10ce567d1692bf64c15928d1",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "give people actionable recommendations that quickly get them back on track",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1a89f3849dd14b46d478b24e73f878b1b94255f229e43161a61d5e8cef88c0da",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "never imply that something’s wrong or that people are at fault",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "138d3cb3d94f95466b00b6ca9ab9fa490421587e54dcadb2161ff18ff3dd75a6",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "never leave people without a clear next step",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Calibration"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "61ad8e557cde5cd09e369fef974b1bf40cf2336474d5457d05776b711dc19b82",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "design ways to avoid mistakes and mitigate them when they happen",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "59b7ae3ff4113eb2b50ae3fa71129d9bc17654934b6da181c7dc99904a079db5",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "use each mistake as a data point that can refine your machine learning models and improve your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "bfd6627ff9db6ecb123195e35e651a7b1ec8c780d2083aed36b738a7bd38fc77",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Show empathy by providing corrective actions or tools that match the seriousness of the mistake",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "996b30111ad0890ca55432ed266aba7f03a79ae6e4291795161653920a83a32e",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "always consider the effect your work has on other areas and overall accuracy",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Mistakes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f425bf23884828f40d985c97cbed3a259eaf95b598d43a4b02efade42f40975a",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "be sure to persist the updates",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a8028fa8df9d39ca742e958087a9eb1577c04e8d2ce84c0654fc623463b90104",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "respond immediately to an updated correction and persist the update",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4c6f55f1d334c0ec148f015ae30597192467f6d6d23e3641404cd87a472e3906",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "make sure that the correction will lead to higher quality results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f452e6bd0e6ba9594cfb7d4988067f083a2480e25dd6ee32fd5c7c969443b031",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "use guided corrections instead of freeform corrections",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Corrections"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c424fa6a45c108426989176c42d25573a2a51c2952ea76c701e3de4c3130eeda",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "use this feedback to refine the options you provide",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Multiple options"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "81c698b518281a800d03f0f4feff5d2c62ed95f71cce393a24836fbd2e0c6a1c",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "consider computing them if you can use them to improve the user experience of your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "057e81863284dcac86e3d3f00452eaeb98ad7223b6eb900214dd430fa300210e",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "You need to verify that your confidence values correspond to the quality of your results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f0e3cfe6bf65f394d67073218e33153e617eb03c85b39d37b6e39a2de0d50902",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "consider ranking or ordering the results in a way that implies confidence levels",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "26fbb16c641ae683bb99bdcf8cb80886de835df117bb9ecab9b500fa88fe0a27",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "consider expressing it in terms of semantic categories",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f20f93092d91449eaaa511fef482b856093cf94b23b66795956ddf5bebf9063f",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "display confidence values that help them interpret the results",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b6bce6fb180ed97aadeb89b84c0d00adf28c46ba906624d9133bdd69f126f6b8",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "help people make decisions by conveying confidence in terms of actionable suggestions",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "caad3ec64ca7feeefcfd4a0282e1ce08661734507575abf0e5655b442245cbf9",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "avoid showing results when confidence is low",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Confidence"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8a788c5d1d0125acfe80262c36ea54dda658ee6714eeb03a9c35154229ca6fed",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Don’t provide an attribution that implies understanding or judgment of people’s emotions, preferences, or beliefs",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Attribution"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f72fe9337cb03b7e6e7679a9ac7c57d59648b59a2d7f93184589ea8c78544130",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "identify the scenarios where limitations impact the user experience",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "fd09ce766e81f43961a1a9a45d6ad424e226afadf9f9b3038ebe6cd8b162b2e7",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "design ways to help people work with them",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "228463266bd174a8330e9a1cdddd73c4abd3e2a6f050e3be2ae2b7a3da6ae51e",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Use placeholder text to suggest input",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e6042224639df744efacb6c0e6013343f91977a48cff5921f197f02402355e99",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "provide feedback on their actions to guide them toward a result without overwhelming them",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "cff32d9971910fea0b32460c71f9633c854c1a554c72d63fc0e80199c450c446",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "you need to understand the goal well enough to suggest alternatives that make sense",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9f0f544bdbb7d4287553fbbba089e681a9703d77542a0624d3ea52e4582a4f5d",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Developer documentation",
      "section_path": [
        "Machine learning",
        "Resources",
        "Developer documentation"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b985db6433c8e9669caebab194ee62b3b3af7505decd93ea111f546d714e1907",
